#: ../../source/unit/bmm350.rst:18 ../../source/unit/bmm350.rst:38
msgid "Read magnetic field and heading"
msgstr "读取磁场和航向角"

#: ../../source/unit/bmm350.rst:20
msgid "Open the |cores3_unit_bmm350_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |cores3_unit_bmm350_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/unit/bmm350.rst:22
msgid ""
"This example displays the heading, X/Y/Z magnetic field values, and sensor temperature. Tap the calibration button to"
" start collecting samples, rotate the Unit through all three axes, then tap the button again to finish."
msgstr ""
"此示例显示航向角、X/Y/Z 三轴磁场值和传感器温度。点击校准按钮开始采样，旋转 Unit 使其经过三个轴向，"
"然后再次点击按钮完成校准。"

