#: ../../source/unit/bmm350.rst:30
msgid ""
"Calibration requires at least 32 samples and at least ``10 uT`` of range on each axis. When the range is "
"insufficient, the example keeps the previous calibration and reports that the calibration should be retried."
msgstr ""
"校准至少需要 32 个样本，并且每个轴的磁场范围至少达到 ``10 uT``。如果范围不足，示例会保留之前的校准结果，"
"并提示重新校准。"

#: ../../source/unit/bmm350.rst:35
msgid "MicroPython Example"
msgstr "MicroPython 应用示例"

#: ../../source/unit/bmm350.rst:40
msgid ""
"This example uses CoreS3 Unit A I2C and continuously refreshes the graphical display with the current magnetic field,"
" temperature, and heading."
msgstr "此示例使用 CoreS3 Unit A 的 I2C 接口，持续刷新图形界面中的当前磁场、温度和航向角。"

