#: ../../source/unit/bmm350.rst:130
msgid ""
"Set the output axis order and direction. Each value must be one of ``1``, ``-1``, ``2``, ``-2``, ``3``, or ``-3``; "
"each source axis must be used exactly once."
msgstr ""
"设置输出轴的顺序和方向。每个值必须为 ``1``、``-1``、``2``、``-2``、``3`` 或 ``-3`` 之一；每个源轴只能使用一次。"

