#: ../../source/unit/bmm350.rst:156
msgid ""
"Apply three hard-iron offsets in ``uT`` and three positive soft-iron scale factors. Both arguments must contain three"
" finite numeric values."
msgstr ""
"应用三个 ``uT`` 单位的硬铁偏移量和三个正数软铁缩放系数。两个参数都必须包含三个有限数值。"

#: ../../source/unit/bmm350.rst:159
msgid "Three hard-iron offsets in ``uT``."
msgstr "三个 ``uT`` 单位的硬铁偏移量。"

#: ../../source/unit/bmm350.rst:160
msgid "Three positive soft-iron scale factors."
msgstr "三个正数软铁缩放系数。"

